 GLES3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 580 Series (radeonsi, polaris10, LLVM 19.1.5, DRM 3.59, 6.12.11-204.nobara.fc41.x86_64) - AMD Ryzen 5 2600 Six-Core Processor (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding an image to a `RichTextLabel` via `add_image()`, its image region cannot be updated via `update_image()` when using `UPDATE_REGION`. The image receives no changes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWith MRP:\n1. Run project\n2. Witness as the image's region fails to be updated\n\nWithout MRP:\n1. Create a `RichTextLabel`\n2. Add an image to the label using `RichTextLabel.add_image()`\n3. Update said image using `RichTextLabel.update_image()`, ensuring that `UPDATE_REGION` is set in the `mask` param\n4. Witness as the image's region fails to be updated\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n4.3: [rtl_update_image_mrp_4.3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18633879/rtl_update_image_mrp_4.3.zip)\n\n4.4b2: [rtl_update_image_mrp_4.4b2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18633884/rtl_update_image_mrp_4.4b2.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"react